"Regulations","nav.selfDiagnostic":"Self-diagnostic","NewsRadarSection.001":"Longevity Radar & Silver Economy","NewsRadarSection.002":"Latest trends, studies, and global regulations compiled in real time from selectable international sources.","NewsRadarSection.003":"Fetching latest news from the selected sources...","NewsRadarSection.004":"⚠️ Could not load news at this time. Please check your connection or feed URLs.","NormativasSection.001":"The 5 Global Foundations of Certification","NormativasSection.002":"Our framework integrates the most demanding global standards to guide companies in adopting pro-age policies with high social and economic impact.","NormativasSection.003":"🌐","NormativasSection.004":"WORK AXIS","NormativasSection.005":"Internal Talent & Employability","NormativasSection.006":"Based on ISO 25550:2022, ILO and UN Treaties","NormativasSection.007":"Defines Sello guidelines to eradicate corporate ageism, ensure retention and employability of senior professionals, and leverage multigenerational teams as a driver for innovation.","NormativasSection.008":"Retention & Career Longevity:","NormativasSection.009":"Programs to conserve senior intellectual capital.","NormativasSection.010":"Reverse Mentoring:","NormativasSection.011":"Bidirectional training between junior and senior staff.","NormativasSection.012":"Blind Resumes:","NormativasSection.013":"Removal of birth dates and photos during candidate screenings.","NormativasSection.014":"View reference standard ISO 25550 ↗","NormativasSection.015":"🤝","NormativasSection.016":"SUPPORT AXIS","NormativasSection.017":"Eldercare & Employee Support","NormativasSection.018":"Based on ISO 25551:2021, WHO and PAHO","NormativasSection.019":'Standardizes corporate support for "sandwich generation" employees, preventing premature career exit by harmonizing work with eldercare duties for dependent relatives.',"NormativasSection.020":"Schedule Adaptability:","NormativasSection.021":"Direct channels for eldercare medical appointments.","NormativasSection.022":"Burnout Mitigation:","NormativasSection.023":"Dedicated emotional support for caregivers.","NormativasSection.024":"Eldercare Leave:","NormativasSection.025":"Flexible time banks designated for eldercare emergencies.","NormativasSection.026":"View reference standard ISO 25551 ↗","NormativasSection.027":"💻","NormativasSection.028":"DIGITAL AXIS","NormativasSection.029":"Senior Customer & Digital Inclusion","NormativasSection.030":"Based on ISO 25556:2025, WHO (Age-Friendly) and IDB Lab","NormativasSection.031":"Regulates channel and tech accessibility to ensure that massive services digitalization does not exclude the over-50 population, capturing the huge potential of the Silver Economy.","NormativasSection.032":"AgeTech Touch Design:","NormativasSection.033":"Interfaces compensating for visual contrast reduction.","NormativasSection.034":"AI & Bias Auditing:","NormativasSection.035":"Reviewing automated algorithms to prevent age discrimination.","NormativasSection.036":"Direct Human Escape:","NormativasSection.037":"Direct one-tap buttons to talk to real support agents.","NormativasSection.038":"View reference standard ISO 25556 ↗","NormativasSection.039":"🏥","NormativasSection.040":"HEALTH & ENVIRONMENT","NormativasSection.041":"WHO Frameworks (Age-Friendly & ICOPE)","NormativasSection.042":"World Health Organization","NormativasSection.043":"Standards for adapting physical environments, accessibility of analog channels coexisting with digital ones, and screening intrinsic capacity.","NormativasSection.044":"Physical environments and buildings free of access barriers.","NormativasSection.045":"Alternative analog/telephone communication channels.","NormativasSection.046":"Community-clinical screening of functional capacities.","NormativasSection.047":"View WHO programs ↗","NormativasSection.048":"🏛️","NormativasSection.049":"INTERNATIONAL TREATY","NormativasSection.050":"ILO Recommendation 162","NormativasSection.051"